  m_Name: Awakening of the Evil Eye
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ID: 
  Parent: 
  RelativePath: 
  Depth: 0
  IsFolder: 0
  CreateFolder: 0
  Content: 'The first and largest Demon attack in recorded Agarthan history. Following
    months of escalating tensions between the native Obscurian people and the Agarthans,
    a horde of Demons suddenly flooded out of the Ruins, indiscriminately attacking
    all in their sight, and causing over a thousand casualties.


    Little is publicly known about what caused the Demon attack, however it is most
    commonly believed that the Evil Eye was instigated by the Obscurians to push out
    the Agarthans from Agartha.'
